plasma-graphmail-linux (0.14.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Mails are drawn without the graphics card by default (Settings >
    Hardware Acceleration for Mail): QtWebEngine's GPU path crashed in the
    graphics driver on a laptop with Intel and NVIDIA graphics. The layout
    stays usable in narrow windows (short date, wrapping sender, minimum
    widths for folders and messages). A clear update-check message while
    the releases are not public.

 -- nvaert1986 <25772781+nvaert1986@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0100

